1
00:00:02,110 --> 00:00:05,170
These buttons under the chart choose how far back it shows.

2
00:00:05,270 --> 00:00:10,890
1M loads the last month. Scroll left to see all of it.

3
00:00:10,990 --> 00:00:14,750
The chart picks a candle size that fits the period.

4
00:00:14,850 --> 00:00:23,350
1Y shows a whole year.

5
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:29,100
1D brings you back to today.

6
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:32,610
This button changes the chart style.

7
00:00:32,710 --> 00:00:42,140
Candles are the default. Line shows only the closing prices.

8
00:00:42,240 --> 00:00:51,680
Heikin Ashi smooths the candles so trends are easier to see.

9
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:55,430
Pick Candles to go back to the usual view.

